{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11105","headline":"因许八奉寄江宁旻上人 · 杜甫","name":"因许八奉寄江宁旻上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不见旻公三十年，对书寄与泪潺湲。\n旧来好事今能否，老去新诗谁与传。\n棊局动随寻涧竹，袈裟忆上泛湖船。\n闻君话我爲官在，头白昏昏只醉眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}